    "detailed_description": "The foreman has had enough. He\u2019s taken a lot of crap from<br>the boss over at Mega Dump Corp. Now it is your turn<br>to turn a ruined outfit into a thriving business and <br>restore the health of the planet! As you grow your operation bigger,<br>you will take on challenges on other planets. Beware though,<br>a dark secret lurks on the planet\u2019s surface.  <br><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1268360/extras/d072a0b5c2eecd488a2cfd0011810769.avif?t=1625085788\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1268360/extras/df9d84a22a03c65d3b9c010769dcffe4.poster.avif?t=1625085788\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1268360/extras/df9d84a22a03c65d3b9c010769dcffe4.webm?t=1625085788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1268360/extras/df9d84a22a03c65d3b9c010769dcffe4.mp4?t=1625085788\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1268360/extras/7b7f8cf1a1b74221b044f7180971a54d.avif?t=1625085788\" /></div><br><br>Trashed is a garbage management action adventure.<br><br>You can build structures for waste management from a <br>3rd person (Top Down) perspective and then protect them with various<br>weapons that you can find or buy on the planet.<br><br>Use vehicles to traverse the surface of each planet faster, or to<br>help you push trash into incinerators or recyclers. <br><br>Take care of the planet, and you will see it return to its original glory.<br>Follow an interesting storyline that evolves as take on new missions<br>and contracts.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img cl